    {
      "id": "legacy-two-grew",
      "title": "Legacy path: two codes grew in one instant is ambiguous",
      "why": "The live-bot single-join path (InviteTracker.attribute) has no magnitudes to split - two growers is genuinely unknowable and stays ambiguous:a+b.",
